<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38030" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανα-βάλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw on</i> or <i>over</i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαναβάλλεσθαι
			θαἰμάτια</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαναβληδόν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				276
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lift up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ λευκὰ τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					12.529a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>put off, defer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρία ἔτεα ἐ. τὴν Σαρδίων ἅλωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.91
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phalar.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				95
			</span></i> (prob.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
